  "description": "NCrontab 6-field format support for HumanCron. Convert natural language schedules like \"every 30 seconds\", \"every 15 minutes\", or \"every day at 2pm\" into NCrontab expressions (seconds-based) and convert back to natural language. Supports complete NCrontab syntax including seconds field, lists, ranges, steps, named values, and L (last day) operator. Compatible with Hangfire, Azure Functions Timer Triggers, and any system using NCrontab format. Features smart compaction, zero-allocation Span<T> parsing, NodaTime timezone handling with DST support. Requires exact version match with HumanCron core package.",
